@anon.9bf146a73cb71d9c7e3fe69f46c42f4a.736 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [496 x i8] }> <{ [496 x i8] c"An entry in a footnote list.\0A\0AThis function is not intended to be called directly. Instead, it is used\0Ain set and show rules to customize footnote listings.\0A\0A_Note:_ Set and show rules for `footnote.entry` must be defined at the\0Abeginning of the document in order to work correctly.\0ASee [here](https://github.com/typst/typst/issues/1348#issuecomment-1566316463)\0Afor more information.\0A\0A```example\0A#show footnote.entry: set text(red)\0A\0AMy footnote listing\0A#footnote[It's down here]\0Ahas red text!\0A```" }>, align 1
